{# The sections, and the ones that are not built yet.

   Listing what is coming is unusual in a panel and right in this one: there is
   one operator, they are the person who decides what gets built next, and a
   rail that showed a single entry would say less than the truth. Nothing here
   is a dead link -- what does not exist is not clickable.

   Fixed, permanent, and the same surface as the content beside it -- Orchid's
   own sidebar, not a separate dark band. `admin.js`'s `railToggle()` drives
   the mobile slide-in and the desktop collapse-to-icons; there is no
   Bootstrap component for either, since Orchid does not use one (A10.1,
   #287).

   The mark is the site's own -- `fa-plane-departure` on brand teal, the same
   icon `footer/bottom.html.twig` and the public header already carry -- drawn
   here with Bootstrap Icons' `bi-airplane-fill` instead of Font Awesome,
   which stays out of the panel (A3.5, #230). Fixed teal in both palettes,
   the same reason `main.css` gives for its own brand tile: a logo is not
   the thing that themes. #}
<div class="rail" id="adminRail">
    <div class="rail__top">
        <a class="rail__mark" href="/" title="Back to the site">
            <span class="rail__mark-logo" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-airplane-fill"></i></span>
            <span>
                <span class="rail__mark-name">{{ config('app.name') }}</span>
                <span class="rail__mark-role">Admin</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-icon d-lg-none" data-rail-close aria-label="Close navigation">
            <i class="bi bi-x-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="rail__body">
        <ul class="rail__list">
            {% for item in [
                { 'href': '/admin', 'label': 'Overview', 'icon': 'speedometer2', 'match': 'overview' },
                { 'href': '/admin/content', 'label': 'Help content', 'icon': 'journal-text', 'match': 'content' },
                { 'href': '/admin/bookings', 'label': 'Bookings', 'icon': 'briefcase', 'match': 'bookings' },
                { 'href': '/admin/subscribers', 'label': 'Fare alerts', 'icon': 'bell', 'match': 'subscribers' }
            ] %}
                {% set current = admin_section|default('') == item.match %}
                <li>
                    <a class="rail__item{{ current ? ' is-current' : '' }}" href="{{ item.href }}"
                       {{ current ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' }}>
                        <i class="bi bi-{{ item.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>{{ item.label }}</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>

        <p class="rail__soon-label">Not built yet</p>
        <ul class="rail__list">
            {% for label in ['Settings'] %}
                <li>
                    <span class="rail__item rail__item--soon">
                        <i class="bi bi-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>{{ label }}</span>
                    </span>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>

        <form method="post" action="/admin/logout" class="rail__out">
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ csrf_field() }}" value="{{ csrf_token() }}">
            <button type="submit" class="button button--quiet button--block">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span>Sign out</span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="rail-backdrop" data-rail-close aria-hidden="true"></div>
